name: open the navigation (star) map from its HUD button, then close it
# The window opens and closes (shots); its map is two POC stand-ins that draw the PIP only (programs/clientpoc/
# poc_world4.cpp: GadgetStarmapClass, GadgetGalaxyMapClass), so the goal "the map shows" waits for them.
expected-fail: the map gadgets are POC stand-ins GadgetStarmapClass / GadgetGalaxyMapClass (the PIP only)
timeout: 400
include _login
alive 8
click gadget hud.navmap
expect-event stubs '^POC input: replayed mouse 0x202 at 140, 946'
stand-in '^STUB first call: POC Gadget(Starmap|GalaxyMap)Class'
alive 4
shot starmap_open
click gadget hud.navmap
expect-event stubs '^POC input: replayed mouse 0x202 at 140, 946'
alive 4
shot starmap_closed
alive 5
